  "provenance": {
    "change_commit": "36248df0d163dc0a41a267abf912b0fccac92fb8",
    "reason": "fix06_17 moved the Crew grievance ledger behind one always-present, fixed-width authenticated capsule while preserving the current landed Coin Pusher V3 and world state",
    "proof": "The golden retains exact raw byte counts and exact hashes for every public field across two seeds and five lifecycle checkpoints. Only valid 64-hex authority ids and valid 65584-byte capsule payloads are replaced with equal-width placeholders before hashing; absent, malformed, or wrong-width envelopes remain unnormalized and fail. Exact WIP 36248df0 independently passed the expanded hidden-information contract and a 512-pair seven-producer-route classifier probe with 512 unique authority ids and IVs. The 48-byte post-load current-environment delta is solely the existing scenario_restore_pending_trusted_rebuild safety marker."
  },
